    fatto_en: "One clarification before the numbers: the correct designation is **0S10**, with a zero, not the letter O — a detail almost every reseller gets wrong, worth having right in the database. It's a pure quartz chronograph module, no mechanical component: 30.8 mm diameter, 4.13 mm thick, zero jewels, 32,768 Hz quartz frequency, SR927W battery (395/399) with an estimated five years of life. It replaces the older Citizen 0510 calibre, and Miyota explicitly sells it as a compatible replacement part.",
